# Documentation audience

- `README.md` is for application developers installing this package. Install,
  requirements, quick start, credentials. No git branches, PR process, or
  coding standards except a single link to `CONTRIBUTING.md`.
- `CONTRIBUTING.md` is for contributors. Clone, toolchain, tests, CLA, commits.
  Do not duplicate merchant install steps from README.
- Never mix these audiences.
